                <invention-title lang="fr">SYSTÈME DE SURVEILLANCE POUR UNE CABINE DE VÉHICULE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">MONITORING SYSTEM FOR A VEHICLE CABIN</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present disclosure relates to a monitoring system for a vehicle cabin, a vehicle comprising such a monitoring system and a method for monitoring a vehicle cabin. The monitoring system comprises a first sensor unit, a second sensor unit and a control unit. The first sensor unit is configured to generate image data of the vehicle cabin. The second sensor unit is configured to generate non-image data of the vehicle cabin. The control unit is configured to collect the image data and the non-image data and determine based thereon whether an obstacle is in the vehicle cabin. The control unit is further configured to limit an actuation of a subsystem if the obstacle is disruptive for the actuation of the subsystem.</p>
            </abstract>
